Positives;
Hello all, Firstly I would recommend this game to anyone, I have so much fun its crazy, I've meet alot of great people and had alot of fun with them,(not like other on-line games), You can either sneak around and search for loot boxes and dodge the beasts (isn't easy) or you can go straight out and track, hunt and kill, or shoot what ever you see and trust me, finding a beast to shoot at is easy as there is plenty around, while looting you dont always get what you want but it can't be too easy can it, I mean we are hunting Dinosours after all, lol. Secondly, The story line is easy, you have been sent there to clear the land so it can be colinized,(simple hey), I've played over 100 hours and I still havn't been all over the map so there is still plenty for me to see, Usually I'm to busy hunting to explore but that would depend on your mood at the time I guess. As you progress though the levels you can buy bigger and better guns (which isn't needed but makes for some fun), Unless your a bad shot like me,lmao. Cheers to all who make the game possible as I will play till I can't. also there is pvp mode, player verse player, if your into that. The game it self is an open world so you can go anywhere you want and I just love it.
Negatives;
There has been some issues in-game but have been worked out (well for me there all good now after the new patch). So yea, buy it, play it, survive it, hunt em, kill em, lol. Cheers.

